---
title: "Filter Component - Legacy"
---

{% warning %}
This page describes the old way of declaring custom filter components when the grid option `enableFilterHandlers` is not set. Legacy filter mode is deprecated in AG Grid 37 and will be removed in a major version after AG Grid 38, when `enableFilterHandlers` also becomes `true` by default. To migrate, see [Migrating to Filter Handlers](./enable-filter-handlers-migration/) on the [Filter Component](./component-filter/) page.
{% /warning %}

The example below shows two custom filters. The first is on the `Athlete` column and demonstrates a filter with "fuzzy" matching and the second is on the `Year` column with preset options.

{% gridExampleRunner title="Custom Filter Component" name="custom-filter-legacy" /%}

